  "body_html": "<h1>rotateBundles_mem</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma rotateBundles_mem (A : Allocation N G) (l : List N) (i : N) (h : i ∈ l) : ∃ k : Fin l.length, l.get k = i ∧ ∃ k' : Fin l.length, (k'.val = (k.val + 1) % l.length) ∧ rotateBundles A l i = A (l.get k')</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Allocation</li>\n<li>Pos</li>\n<li>IsZeroSum.head</li>\n<li>Subtree.head</li>\n</ul>",
